{"seq":15,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-none-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:36:46.955Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"063a2ae474422ef77dfa47eba104baa58ac57227095890f1cd481368d3a9d5e5","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, here's what Moss's Strategic digests show (latest dated ones win; the undated cheat sheet is stale and still has the old Nadia/Gideon split):\n• Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. It moved from Nadia Fennimore on 2026-05-04. Moss's 5/3 prep note says it \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest confirms the CRM reassignment that day. The 8/3 digest calls it Gideon's biggest account.\n• Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato. Every digest from 2025 to 2026 lists it as Gideon's fleet account. The 5/4 digest also says he \"assumed management\" of it that day, which is odd since he already ran it, so check that line before it goes on the slide.\n• Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato, but this is inferred. The digests never name Orlavine as Gideon's. They call it \"Nadia's medical account\" in 3/2025, then \"Gideon's medical account\" in 12/2025 and 9/2026. I couldn't find an exact handover date.\n• Quillfeather Outfitters: the digests don't say who owns it. They only call it the pod's outdoor/retail account. Nadia is hosting its gate-clerk training in the 9/30 digest, but that doesn't make her the owner. Please confirm in the CRM; I can't see the account CRM files from here.\nThe only date I'd put on the slide is the Vantorre Group handover, 2026-05-04.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
{"seq":16,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-none-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:36:51.254Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"89d6d7c49136bfc474f9717c714f5ad3ca5f11192219fbbda386c279b7dc82fc","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"I replied to Ruth in the #strategic-pod thread. Two of the four owners come with caveats.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It moved from Nadia Fennimore on 2026-05-04. Moss's 5/3 prep note says it \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest confirms the CRM reassignment that day.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. Every digest lists it as his fleet account. The 5/4 digest also says he \"assumed management\" of it that day, which looks odd since he already ran it, so I flagged that line for Ruth to check.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato, but this is inferred. The digests call it \"Nadia's medical account\" in 3/2025 and \"Gideon's medical account\" in 12/2025 and 9/2026. They never name Orlavine as Gideon's, and I found no exact handover date.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** the digests don't say who owns it. Nadia is hosting its gate-clerk training in the 9/30 digest, but that doesn't make her the owner. I asked Ruth to confirm in the CRM, since I can't see the account CRM files from here.\n\nI treated the undated cheat sheet as stale because it still has the old Nadia/Gideon split. I only used the channel and the public digests, which Ruth can see herself, and quoted no finance figures."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
